  "name": "Qatar",
  "note": [
   "The law gives Pantone 1955 C and white. The hex and CMYK values are Wikipedia's for that Pantone, as FOTW reports them. The Album des Pavillons 2023 gives a different color, Pantone 222 C, so it isn't used here.",
   "Annex 1 says 11:28 is for use inside Qatar, and that abroad a flag follows the host country's proportions by Figures 5 to 8. Those are the variants here.",
   "Figure 8 labels its triangle length 16% of 2/3 L, but its whole table works out to 18%, and the variant follows the table."
  ],
